      "studyDesign": "This dataset includes anatomical MRI data from n=119 Polish-English bilingual participants acquired using two 3T scanners, along with a comprehensive behavioral assessment of bilingual language experience using both questionnaires and experimental tasks. Each participant also completed two functional localizer tasks targeting the language network (intact > degraded speech) and the multiple demand (MD) network (hard > easy visual working memory task).",
